    "raw_text": "Software Installation & Setup FAQ\nDomain: Application installation and initial configuration.\nDataset purpose: This document is a sample knowledge-base source for a Multimodal\nRetrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) FAQ system.\nThe visual above is intentionally embedded so the data-extraction module can detect and extract images from the PDF.\nQ1. What should I check before installing software?\nCheck the supported operating system, available storage, required permissions, and any documented\nprerequisites.\nQ2. Where should I download an installer from?\nUse the official software source or another source explicitly authorized by the software provider. Avoid\nunknown download locations.\nQ3. What should I do if installation stops with an error?\nRead the exact error message, verify available storage and permissions, and restart the installation. Record\nthe error if support is required.\nQ4. Why does the application not start after installation?\nCheck whether the application meets its system requirements. Restart the device and review any startup\nerror message.\nSource type: Synthetic sample FAQ document | Suitable for local development and extraction testing.",
